My top three confusions:
1. The drill log's "Mark complete" flow lets the log go to "complete" status the instant you tap Complete on the hours card — *before* the driller signature exists. I saw "✓ Marked complete" sitting next to an unsigned "Tap to sign" button at the same time.
2. The hours/time-card job picker listed "Ledgeville Pit — Phase 1" twice, with no way to tell which one was actually my job — I had to guess.
3. Several buttons right after a state change (a filed checklist's "Done," the drill log tour's "Skip," and "Tap to sign" right after marking complete) didn't respond to normal or even coordinate taps on the first try — same symptom recurring in three different spots, which felt like one underlying UI timing bug rather than three unrelated ones.

